      module mod_periodic
CC this module containes information about the atoms
CC it has the 'structure element' which containes all
CC the attributes of each atom, used for the FLAPW calculation
CC can be extended to include other typical information usually
CC set for each atom type, like lmt or lmax etc.......
CC option 'minimum' may work
CC kmax*rmt ~ lmax (=<8)

